msgid "Leave empty to keep the kernel-reported value or the device-class default."
msgstr "留空则保留内核报告值或设备类型默认值。"

msgid "Limit"
msgstr "上限"

msgid "Limits shown as assumed are not reported by the kernel for that sensor; a default for the device class is used instead."
msgstr "标记为推定的上限并非内核为该传感器报告的数值，而是按设备类型采用的默认值。"

msgid "Live readings from every temperature sensor the kernel exposes. Each graph is scaled to that device's own critical point, so a low trace means real headroom."
msgstr "实时显示内核暴露的所有温度传感器读数。每张图按该设备自身的临界温度缩放，因此曲线越低代表余量越充足。"

