msgstr "NVMe 传感器 %d"

msgid "No temperature sensors detected."
msgstr "未检测到温度传感器。"

msgid "One row per chip, showing its hottest sensor."
msgstr "每颗芯片只显示最热的传感器。"

msgid "Override warning and critical limits per sensor, or hide a sensor from the status pages."
msgstr "逐个传感器覆盖降频与临界上限，或从状态页隐藏某个传感器。"

msgid "Peak"
msgstr "峰值"

msgid "Plotting %d of %d sensors; all readings are listed below."
msgstr "图中绘制 %d 个传感器（共 %d 个），下方列出全部读数。"

